1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:03,113
Har mahine platform fee kyun bharni?

2
00:00:04,413 --> 00:00:12,527
Bombay Marketing banata hai WooCommerce store — koi monthly platform fee nahi, poora ownership aapka.

3
00:00:13,377 --> 00:00:20,779
Design aapke brand jaisa, aur speed tez — caching, image optimisation, lean code.

4
00:00:21,629 --> 00:00:29,909
Razorpay, UPI, cards, COD… saath mein shipping, tax aur GST setup.

5
00:00:30,759 --> 00:00:38,475
Security, SSL, regular backups… aur SEO ke liye product schema aur sitemap.

6
00:00:39,325 --> 00:00:47,829
Typically 3 se 5 hafte. Aur agar Shopify behtar fit hai, toh hum imaandaari se bata denge.

7
00:00:49,979 --> 00:00:55,538
Apna product range bataiye, quote lijiye — bombaymarketing.in
